// GENERATED FILE: do not edit by hand.
//
// Accent and neutral color roles for every [AppTheme], generated offline (Material 3
// audit, phase 2) with Material's HCT color model from each theme's own seed and
// background colors:
//  - Seeds are kept exactly when they already meet WCAG AA (4.5:1) against the surface
//    and their on-color. Otherwise the nearest passing tone of the seed's own palette
//    (same hue and chroma) is used.
//  - Containers are tone 90 (light) / 30 (dark); on-container colors reach 7:1.
//  - Neutral roles (onSurface, outline, ...) use the background's own hue.
// Every pair checked: primary/secondary/tertiary vs on-colors, surface and
// surfaceContainerHighest; containers vs on-containers; onSurface(Variant) and outline
// vs surface, in light, dark and AMOLED.
// To change a theme, edit its seeds in AppTheme and regenerate this file.

